From: kadie@eff.org (Carl M. Kadie)
Subject: Re: Acceptable Use Policies (Was Re: Bill's... )
Message-ID: <1991Oct4.180750.3733@eff.org>
References: <E5808ED93A2056A5@ccmail.sunysb.edu> <1991Oct03.204416.24141@eng.umd.edu> <1991Oct4.144225.13879@ms.uky.edu>
